  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " means 'for you' in the polite form.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "На моей кухне должен быть идеальный порядок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'There must be perfect order in my kitchen.' The term ",
